  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 114 (Friday, June 30, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. GARAMENDI:\nH.R. 4409.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, section 8\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nThis legislation closes loopholes in current acquisition\nlaws, tie financial incentives for contractors to\nperformance, and provide the Department of Defense (DoD) with\nthe information necessary to ensure fair and accurate\npricing.\n[Page H3160]\n</pre>",
